00:06:25.815 --> 00:06:29.848
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:06:30.447 --> 00:06:37.624
<v Slow>今年の夏の「土用の丑の日」は、何月何日ですか。

00:06:38.423 --> 00:06:40.824
